{"id":57335,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57335"},"modified":"2026-10-19T23:20:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T22:20:50","slug":"proenca-cross-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/proenca-cross-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026<\/strong> (13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>). Organizado pela associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Interior Convida<\/strong> em coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>Horizontes Turismo Desportivo<\/strong> e em conformidade com os regulamentos da FPA e da ATRP, o evento percorre os trilhos, serras e aldeias do territ\u00f3rio florestal de Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, com chegada unificada na vila.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa competitivo integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias cronometradas por chip: o <strong>Trail Ultra de 49,6 km<\/strong> (2.492 m D+, Grau ATRP 2, percurso linear com partida \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> em Montes da Senhora e chegada em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, limite de 12 horas), o <strong>Trail Sprint de 25 km<\/strong> (1.414 m D+, Grau ATRP 3, percurso linear com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> em Cunqueiros e chegada em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, limite de 8 horas) e o <strong>Trail Jovem de 14,7 km<\/strong> (632 m D+, Grau ATRP 2, percurso circular com partida e chegada em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, limite de 5 horas).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem brinde de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, dorsal, seguro desportivo, transporte at\u00e9 \u00e0 linha de partida para as provas lineares (Ultra e Sprint), tracks GPS, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, medalha finisher, duches e lanche de reposi\u00e7\u00e3o na meta. Na campanha de equipas, na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o de cada 6 atletas a 6\u00aa inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 de oferta. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o porte de reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, telem\u00f3vel operacional, copo e tigela (<em>bowl<\/em>) reutiliz\u00e1veis. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, Castelo Branco<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: