px;\">Trail Sprint 25K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 1414m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Early Bird:<\/strong> 27.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (04\/08 a 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Etapa Final:<\/strong> 32.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 21\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Jovem 15K (14,7 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 632m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Early Bird:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (04\/08 a 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Etapa Final:<\/strong> 22.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 21\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, os hor\u00e1rios e os locais de partida do Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, todas com meta em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova: o Trail Ultra (49,6 km) parte \u00e0s 08:00 de Montes da Senhora; o Trail Sprint (25 km) parte \u00e0s 09:00 de Cunqueiros; e o Trail Jovem (14,7 km) parte \u00e0s 10:00 de Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, o desn\u00edvel positivo e os tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Ultra tem 49,6 km com 2.492 m D+ (Grau ATRP 2 e tempo m\u00e1ximo de 12 horas); o Trail Sprint tem 25 km com 1.414 m D+ (Grau ATRP 3 e tempo m\u00e1ximo de 8 horas); e o Trail Jovem tem 14,7 km com 632 m D+ (Grau ATRP 2 e tempo m\u00e1ximo de 5 horas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 4 de agosto a 21 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases \u2014 Early Bird (at\u00e9 31\/08) e Etapa Final (at\u00e9 21\/11): Trail Ultra (37 \u20ac \/ 41 \u20ac), Trail Sprint (27 \u20ac \/ 32 \u20ac) e Trail Jovem (20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac). Para equipas, a cada 6 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a 6\u00aa \u00e9 gratuita.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pelo regulamento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua, manta t\u00e9rmica de sobreviv\u00eancia, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, reserva alimentar, copo reutiliz\u00e1vel e tigela (bowl) para sopa nos abastecimentos\/meta. No Trail Ultra \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m exigida lanterna ou luz frontal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que idades m\u00ednimas e escal\u00f5es s\u00e3o admitidos em cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Ultra \u00e9 reservado a maiores de 20 anos; o Trail Sprint admite atletas a partir dos 18 anos (Sub-20); e o Trail Jovem (14,7 km) est\u00e1 aberto a atletas a partir dos 16 anos (Sub-18, mediante autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o do encarregado de educa\u00e7\u00e3o). Os 3 primeiros da geral ganham trof\u00e9u e o 1\u00ba recebe ainda inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Interior Convida e Horizontes Turismo Desportivo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, os hor\u00e1rios e os locais de partida do Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, todas com meta em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova: o Trail Ultra (49,6 km) parte \u00e0s 08:00 de Montes da Senhora; o Trail Sprint (25 km) parte \u00e0s 09:00 de Cunqueiros; e o Trail Jovem (14,7 km) parte \u00e0s 10:00 de Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, o desn\u00edvel positivo e os tempos limite de cada prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Ultra tem 49,6 km com 2.492 m D+ (Grau ATRP 2 e tempo m\u00e1ximo de 12 horas); o Trail Sprint tem 25 km com 1.414 m D+ (Grau ATRP 3 e tempo m\u00e1ximo de 8 horas); e o Trail Jovem tem 14,7 km com 632 m D+ (Grau ATRP 2 e tempo m\u00e1ximo de 5 horas).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Proen\u00e7a Cross Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 4 de agosto a 21 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases \u2014 Early Bird (at\u00e9 31\/08) e Etapa Final (at\u00e9 21\/11): Trail Ultra (37 \u20ac \/ 41 \u20ac), Trail Sprint (27 \u20ac \/ 32 \u20ac) e Trail Jovem (20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac). Para equipas, a cada 6 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a 6\u00aa \u00e9 gratuita.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pelo regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua, manta t\u00e9rmica de sobreviv\u00eancia, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, reserva alimentar, copo reutiliz\u00e1vel e tigela (bowl) para sopa nos abastecimentos\/meta. No Trail Ultra \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m exigida lanterna ou luz frontal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que idades m\u00ednimas e escal\u00f5es s\u00e3o admitidos em cada dist\u00e2ncia?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Ultra \u00e9 reservado a maiores de 20 anos; o Trail Sprint admite atletas a partir dos 18 anos (Sub-20); e o Trail Jovem (14,7 km) est\u00e1 aberto a atletas a partir dos 16 anos (Sub-18, mediante autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o do encarregado de educa\u00e7\u00e3o). Os 3 primeiros da geral ganham trof\u00e9u e o 1\u00ba recebe ainda inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70254,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[535,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-57335","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-proenca-a-nova-castelo-branco","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-castelo-branco","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-proenca-cross-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57335","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=57335"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57335\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70255,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57335\/revisions\/70255"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70254